---
/**
 * Booking Terms & Conditions — scoped for the UK and the whole EU/EEA.
 *
 * A retreat here combines accommodation, transfers and activities sold at an
 * inclusive price, which makes it a "package" and Courtside its organiser
 * under Directive (EU) 2015/2302 and the UK Package Travel and Linked Travel
 * Arrangements Regulations 2018.
 */
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import FooterIsland from '../../components/FooterIsland';
import { getWhatsAppConciergeUrl } from '../../constants/urls';
import { sitePath } from '../../constants/site';

const title = 'Booking Terms & Conditions | Courtside Padel Retreats';
const description =
  'Booking terms for Courtside Padel Retreats: payment, changes, cancellation, package travel rights and liability, for travellers in the UK and the EU.';
const canonical = sitePath('/legal/terms-and-conditions');
const waUrl = getWhatsAppConciergeUrl(
  'Hello, I have a question about the Courtside Padel booking terms.'
);
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} lang="en" locale="en">
  <main id="main-content" class="bg-white min-h-screen pt-32 pb-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-8">

      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-brand-gold font-semibold mb-4">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light text-brand-dark tracking-wide mb-4">Booking Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
      <p class="text-brand-dark/50 text-sm mb-12">Last updated: September 2026</p>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-brand-dark/80 space-y-10">

        <section>
          <p class="text-brand-dark/70">These terms apply to every Courtside Padel retreat. They follow the <strong>UK Package Travel and Linked Travel Arrangements Regulations 2018</strong> and the <strong>EU Package Travel Directive (EU) 2015/2302</strong>.</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-brand-dark/70">Nothing in these terms removes or limits a right the law gives you. If a clause conflicts with a consumer protection that applies to you, that protection wins. These terms are published in English, and the English version governs.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-light text-brand-dark mb-4">At a glance</h2>
          <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse mt-3">
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-brand-dark/10">
              <tr><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-semibold text-brand-dark align-top">Deposit</td><td class="py-2">£300 per person secures your place</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-semibold text-brand-dark align-top">Balance</td><td class="py-2">Due 15 days before the start date</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-semibold text-brand-dark align-top">Booking deadline</td><td class="py-2">Bookings close 15 days before the start date</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-semibold text-brand-dark align-top">Cancel 1 month before start date</td><td class="py-2">Full refund, including your deposit</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-semibold text-brand-dark align-top">Cancel less than 1 month before start date</td><td class="py-2">No refund</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-semibold text-brand-dark align-top">Not included</td><td class="py-2">Flights and travel insurance</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-light text-brand-dark mb-4">1. Who you are booking with</h2>
          <p>Crtside Events Ltd, trading as Courtside Padel Retreats. Registered in England and Wales, Company No. 16289087, 24 Hendham Road, London SW17 7DQ, United Kingdom.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">By booking, you confirm you are 18 or over and can accept these terms for everyone in your party. Please share our information with them.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-light text-brand-dark mb-4">2. Your retreat</h2>
          <p>Each retreat combines accommodation, padel coaching, activities and, where stated, meals and ground transport, sold together at one price. This makes it a package holiday and makes us the organiser, so you have all the rights package travel law gives you.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">What is included is set out on the retreat page and in your written booking confirmation. The confirmation and these terms form your contract. If they differ, the confirmation applies.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">Flights are not included unless your confirmation says so.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">Airport transfers are included where the retreat page says so.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">Places are limited. Dates are confirmed at the point of booking.</p>
          <p class="mt-3"><strong>Accommodation:</strong> in rare cases we may need to use a different hotel of an equal or higher standard. We will tell you as soon as possible. If this is a significant change, section 7 applies.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-light text-brand-dark mb-4">3. Booking and payment</h2>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-brand-dark mb-2 mt-4">3.1 Deposit</h3>
          <p>A deposit of <strong>£300 per person</strong> secures your place. Your booking is confirmed once we have received your deposit and sent you a written confirmation.</p>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-brand-dark mb-2 mt-4">3.2 Balance</h3>
          <p>The total balance is due <strong>15 days before the retreat start date</strong>. The exact date will be in your confirmation. If it is not paid on time, we may treat your booking as cancelled by you (see section 6).</p>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-brand-dark mb-2 mt-4">3.3 Booking deadline</h3>
          <p>Bookings close 15 days before the start date.</p>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-brand-dark mb-2 mt-4">3.4 Prices</h3>
          <p>Prices are per person, based on sharing a room, and include applicable taxes. A single-room supplement applies where shown. If you pay in another currency, your bank's exchange rate and charges apply.</p>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-brand-dark mb-2 mt-4">3.5 No hidden charges</h3>
          <p>We do not add card surcharges above our own cost, and we never use pre-ticked boxes. Optional extras are only added if you choose them.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-light text-brand-dark mb-4">4. Price changes after booking</h2>
          <p>Your price is fixed once confirmed. The law allows only one exception: we may increase it if fuel costs for transport, third-party taxes or fees (such as tourist taxes), or exchange rates change.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">We must tell you at least 20 days before the start date and show you how we worked it out. If the increase is more than 8% of the total price, you can cancel for a full refund. If these costs go down, you are entitled to a reduction.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-light text-brand-dark mb-4">5. Changing your booking</h2>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-brand-dark mb-2 mt-4">5.1 Transferring your place</h3>
          <p>You can transfer your booking to someone else if you tell us in writing at least 7 days before the start date. You and the new guest are jointly responsible for any unpaid balance and any reasonable extra costs of the transfer.</p>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-brand-dark mb-2 mt-4">5.2 Other changes</h3>
          <p>We will try to help with changes to dates or rooms where possible and will tell you any cost before you commit.</p>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-brand-dark mb-2 mt-4">5.3 Small changes by us</h3>
          <p>We may make minor changes, such as swapping an activity for one of equal quality or adjusting times for weather. We will let you know in writing.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-light text-brand-dark mb-4">6. Cancelling your booking</h2>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-brand-dark mb-2 mt-4">6.1 If you cancel</h3>
          <p>Email us at <span class="text-brand-gold">awatelet@cspadel.com</span>. Your cancellation takes effect on the day we receive it.</p>
          <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse mt-3">
            <thead>
              <tr class="border-b border-brand-dark/20">
                <th class="text-left py-2 pr-4 font-semibold text-brand-dark">When you cancel</th>
                <th class="text-left py-2 font-semibold text-brand-dark">Refund</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-brand-dark/10">
              <tr><td class="py-2 pr-4">1 month or more before the start date</td><td class="py-2">Full refund of everything you have paid, including your deposit</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-2 pr-4">Less than 1 month before the start date</td><td class="py-2">No refund</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
          <p class="mt-3">If you believe this charge is higher than our actual costs justify, ask us and we will explain it.</p>

          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-brand-dark mb-2 mt-4">6.2 Extraordinary circumstances</h3>
          <p>You can cancel for a full refund if unavoidable and extraordinary circumstances at or near the destination, such as a natural disaster or serious safety risk, significantly affect the retreat or your travel to it.</p>

          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-brand-dark mb-2 mt-4">6.3 No cooling-off period</h3>
          <p>The 14-day cooling-off period for online purchases does not apply to package holidays. Your rights in sections 5.1, 6.2 and 7 are not affected.</p>

          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-brand-dark mb-2 mt-4">6.4 Refunds</h3>
          <p>Any refund is paid within 14 days.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-light text-brand-dark mb-4">7. If we change or cancel your retreat</h2>
          <p>If we need to make a significant change to your retreat, we will tell you straight away. You can then accept the change, take an alternative retreat, or cancel for a full refund.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">We may cancel and give you a full refund if:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mt-3">
            <li>the minimum number of guests is not reached, and we tell you at least 2 weeks before the start date; or</li>
            <li>unavoidable and extraordinary circumstances prevent the retreat from going ahead.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">If we cancel for any other reason, you will receive a full refund and may also be entitled to compensation.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-light text-brand-dark mb-4">8. If something goes wrong during your retreat</h2>
          <p>We are responsible for every service in your package, whether we provide it or a partner does.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">Tell us straight away so we can put it right. If we cannot, you may be entitled to a price reduction and/or compensation, unless the problem was caused by you, by an unforeseeable third party, or by extraordinary circumstances. If you are in difficulty during the retreat, we will help.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">Except for death, personal injury, or loss caused intentionally or through negligence, our liability is limited to <strong>three times the price of your package</strong>.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-light text-brand-dark mb-4">9. Financial protection</h2>
          <p>Before you pay a deposit, we will confirm in writing how your money is protected.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-light text-brand-dark mb-4">10. Your responsibilities</h2>
          <p><strong>Health:</strong> padel is a physical sport. Please tell us in advance about any medical condition, injury, allergy or accessibility need.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">Travel insurance covering cancellation, medical costs and travel disruption is <strong>mandatory</strong>.</p>
          <p class="mt-3"><strong>Travel documents:</strong> you are responsible for your passport, visas and any entry requirements.</p>
          <p class="mt-3"><strong>Conduct:</strong> please treat other guests, our team and our partners with respect. We may end the participation of anyone whose behaviour is seriously disruptive or unsafe, without refund.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-light text-brand-dark mb-4">11. Complaints</h2>
          <p>Please raise any problem during the retreat so we can fix it. If it is still unresolved, email <span class="text-brand-gold">awatelet@cspadel.com</span>. We will reply within 5 working days and aim to resolve it within 28 days.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">EEA consumers can also contact an approved alternative dispute resolution body or the European Consumer Centre in their country.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-light text-brand-dark mb-4">12. Privacy</h2>
          <p>We handle your personal data as described in our <a href="/legal/privacy-policy" class="text-brand-gold underline underline-offset-2">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-light text-brand-dark mb-4">13. Governing law</h2>
          <p>These terms are governed by the law of <strong>England and Wales</strong>. If you live in the EEA, you keep the protection of your own country's consumer law and may bring a claim in your local courts. UK residents in Scotland or Northern Ireland may bring a claim there.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">If any part of these terms is found unenforceable, the rest still applies.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-light text-brand-dark mb-4">14. Contact</h2>
          <p><span class="text-brand-gold">awatelet@cspadel.com</span>, or message us on <a href={waUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-gold underline underline-offset-2">WhatsApp</a>.</p>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>
    <FooterIsland client:visible locale="en" />
  </main>
</Layout>
